SOURCE DATA
-----------
The data published here is derived from New Zealand government open data. It
remains under the licences of the agencies that published it, as recorded
dataset by dataset in DATA_SOURCES.yaml, with the attribution required by those
licences given in ATTRIBUTION.md.

Most of it is used under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0) — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Three sources are used under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 New Zealand
(CC BY 3.0 NZ) — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/nz/ — namely the
Charities Register datasets, the DIA quarterly gaming machine proceeds summary
by territorial authority, and the New Zealand Treaties Online register.

VERIFIED AT SOURCE
------------------
On 30 August 2026 every licence in this repository was checked online against
the publisher's own page or the dataset's own data.govt.nz catalogue record.
DATA_SOURCES.yaml records for each dataset the licence, where the claim was read
(`licence_basis`: dataset_page or agency_record) and the URL it was read at
(`licence_evidence`). No published dataset is unverified.

Datasets still marked `licence_issue: true` are those where the strongest
statement that exists is agency-wide rather than dataset-specific. That flag
describes the strength of the evidence, not a doubt about the licence — the
statement itself was read at source in every case and is recorded.

The three API-key sources — the LINZ Data Service, the MfE Data Service and the
Stats NZ Aotearoa Data Explorer — were checked on two separate questions: the
licence on each layer or dataflow, and whether the portal's own terms of use
permit redistribution of derived extracts. Every layer is CC BY 4.0 and every
portal permits redistribution; the API key gates access, not reuse. Those
answers are recorded in the `portal_terms` field of each entry.

Nothing in this repository grants you any right in the source data beyond what
its own publisher's licence grants you. Where a source licence and the MIT
licence appear to conflict, the source licence governs the data.

MODIFIED
--------
The data here HAS BEEN MODIFIED. It was downloaded, staged, transformed,
trimmed for publication, and in places mixed with synthetic records. It is not
what any agency published. Attribution to those agencies does not imply their
endorsement of this repository, and no figure here should be relied on for
operational, policy, or reporting purposes. Use the agencies' own releases.

SYNTHETIC DATA
--------------
Synthetic records in this repository (SYN_VENUE_GMP) are generated by this
build, are offered as CC0 / demonstration only, and carry no statistical
meaning. They describe no real venue, society, or person.
